  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5917.13 Wheelchair Vans for Hire License Renewal Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5917.13 Wheelchair Vans for Hire License Renewal Process. Any currently licensed wheelchair vans shall be eligible for renewal, prior to lapse, by complying with the chair van company requirements set forth in Saf-C 5917.08, and shall be issued a license, commencing with the month of the inspection and expiring on the last day of that month 2 years later.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
